   "source": [
    "## FT\n",
    "$$X(f) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x(t) e^{-j 2\\pi f t} dt$$\n",
    "$$x(t) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} X(f) e^{j 2\\pi f t} df$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "27e963de",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Frequency Shifting - FT\n",
    "$$\\mathcal{F}\\{m(t)\\} = M(f) \\implies \\mathcal{F}\\{m(t) \\, e^{j 2\\pi f_0 t}\\} = M(f - f_0)$$\n"
   ]
  }
